ed by this fixture.\n{\n    \"$schema\": \"https://schemas.kicad.org/drc.v1.json\",\n    \"coordinate_units\": \"mm\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-10-16T17:39:44\",\n    \"ignored_checks\": [\n        {\n            \"description\": \"Footprint has no courtyard defined\",\n            \"key\": \"missing_courtyard\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"description\": \"Track endpoint not centered on via\",\n            \"key\": \"track_not_centered_on_via\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"description\": \"Tuning profile track geometries\",\n            \"key\": \"tuning_profile_track_geometries\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"description\": \"Footprint doesn't match symbol's footprint filters\",\n            \"key\": \"footprint_filters_mismatch\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"description\": \"Footprint component type doesn't match footprint pads\",\n            \"key\": \"footprint_type_mismatch\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"included_severities\": [\n        \"error\",\n        \"warning\",\n        \"exclusion\"\n    ],\n    \"kicad_version\": \"10.0.7\",\n    \"schematic_parity\": [],\n    \"source\": \"rc_filter.kicad_pcb\",\n    \"unconnected_items\": [],\n    \"violations\": []\n}\n* agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native XML netlist\nC1 OUT 0 100n\nR1 IN OUT 10k\nVSTEP IN 0 PWL(0 0 1n 1)\n.tran 0.005m 5m\n.meas tran vout_1ms FIND v(OUT) AT=1m\n.meas tran vout_5ms FIND v(OUT) AT=5m\n.end\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee generated ngspice control script\n\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: * agent-ee rc_transient deck, generated from the native xml netlist\n\nDoing analysis at TEMP = 27.000000 and TNOM = 27.000000\n\nUsing SPARSE 1.3 as Direct Linear Solver\n\nInitial Transient Solution\n--------------------------\n\nNode                                   Voltage\n----                                   -------\nout                                          0\nin                    